Agents Go

Agents Go is a modified version of Herdr (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr),
based on upstream commit 331775c. The upstream Git history and Apache-2.0
license are retained. Agents Go is not an official Herdr release.

Agents Go contributors modified the project tree, agent activity display,
recent-project persistence and recovery, and fork configuration. Changed source
files contain modification notices. For generated JSON and JSON data files,
adjacent .license files carry the notices without changing the data format.

Third-party notices remain in their original locations, including:
- vendor/libghostty-vt/LICENSE (MIT; Ghostty contributors)
- vendor/portable-pty/LICENSE.md (MIT; Wez Furlong)
- packaging/windows/licenses/ (Microsoft ConPTY license and notices)

This notice supplements, and does not replace, those licenses or notices.
